    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51455" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθῠ-ηρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
